      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There's no way to ask this without it sounding extremely rude, but is there any particular reason why this bug has taken so long to fix? Is it an issue with photon or something weird like that? I imagine its one of those situations right now where fixing it causes tons of other things to break, but thats just speculation\nIs the cause of why it's happening just not clear? It really sucks being \"in the dark\" on such an infamous bug",
