      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you can't TALK as the MASTER of your OWN instance, then you can't actually create a private instance. This is not an audio bug, this is a top tier functionality issue that is 100% repeatable, and has been a known for months, and now people are paying to have totally unusable private spaces, until they hit re-join, lose control over their own instance and pass the bug to the next person, deemed room master. It's most likely a sync issue, but as Mods have already done the work to fix this, you guys already have the answer to address it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
